      }
    },
    "The active plan is set. The week schedule will appear here as soon as the latest plan snapshot finishes syncing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El plan activo está listo. El calendario semanal aparecerá aquí cuando termine de sincronizarse."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前计划已设置。最新计划同步完成后，每周安排会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The activity suggestion is linked to an active plan. The full plan will appear here as soon as the latest plan state finishes loading." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta sugerencia forma parte del plan activo. El plan completo aparecerá aquí cuando termine de cargarse."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这项训练建议来自当前计划。最新计划加载完成后，完整内容会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gap does not matter. One comfortable session does." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La pausa no importa. Lo que cuenta es volver con una sesión cómoda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停了多久不重要，舒服地跑一次，就是新的开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original workout still fits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原训练仍然适合你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The work is in. Anything else is optional." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El trabajo ya está hecho. Lo demás es un extra."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该做的已经做完，其他都是锦上添花。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme" : {
      "comment" : "A section that lets users select a theme.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "These are the facts and patterns Plainstride may use when adapting training. You can correct or forget any item." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta es la información que Plainstride puede usar para adaptar tu entrenamiento. Puedes corregir o eliminar cualquier elemento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是平步青云在调整训练时可能使用的信息和规律。你可以修改或删除任何一项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These optional details help Plainstride personalize training load, recovery advice, and estimates. They stay private and are never shown in Together." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the training profile form.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estos datos opcionales ayudan a Plainstride a adaptar la carga de entrenamiento, las recomendaciones de recuperación y las estimaciones. Son privados y nunca se muestran en Comunidad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些选填信息可帮助平步青云更合理地调整训练量、恢复建议和相关估算。信息仅供你本人使用，不会显示在“跑圈”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These profile details do not change how you sign in." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the user's contact details are used.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estos datos del perfil no cambian la forma en que inicias sesión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些个人资料不会更改你的登录方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pensando…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在思考…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This activity may have been removed or is no longer shared with you." : {
      "comment" : "A description of why a post is unavailable.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que esta actividad se haya eliminado o que ya no se comparta contigo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此活动可能已被删除，或不再与你分享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This approachable run builds consistency while Plainstride learns your natural easy effort." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta carrera asequible refuerza la constancia mientras Plainstride aprende cuál es tu esfuerzo suave natural."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次轻松跑能帮你养成规律，也让平步青云逐渐了解最适合你的轻松强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This includes the app version, device type, and iOS version. It does not include health, location, or account data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto incluye la versión de la aplicación, el tipo de dispositivo y la versión de iOS. No incluye datos de salud, ubicación o cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中包括应用版本、设备型号和 iOS 版本，不包括健康、位置或账户数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is your personal recording from an activity event. Shared participant results remain in Social." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este es tu registro personal de una actividad compartida. Los resultados del grupo siguen disponibles en Comunidad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是你在共同活动中的个人记录。参与者的汇总结果仍可在“跑圈”中查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your Plainstride account, synced activities, plans, profile, social data, and locally stored Plainstride data. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto eliminará permanentemente tu cuenta de Plainstride, actividades sincronizadas, planes, perfil, datos sociales y datos guardados en el dispositivo. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你的平步青云账户、已同步活动、计划、个人资料、社交数据和本地保存的平步青云数据。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
